error_signature: "L1e: test passed WITHOUT package artifacts|fake test detected \\(R34\\)|test does not depend on .* -- must call its API or execute its binary|L1_RESULT=fail: negative test"
root_cause: "CI 的 L1e 破坏性负向测试用**单个 -pr** 调用 `conan test <test_pkg> <ref> -pr <profile> --build=missing`。Conan 2 里单个 -pr 只作用于 **host**，settings_build 回落到机器默认 profile，于是 cross_building 变成 True；而 can_run() 的定义就是 `not cross_building(self)`，因此 can_run 恒为 False。test_package 里惯用的 `if not can_run(self): return` 会**静默返回成功**：零断言执行、L1e 看不到任何真实依赖，于是判定为「假测试」。注意 conan create 流水线用的是 `-pr:h` + `-pr:b`（build==host），can_run 为 True，所以同一个 test_package 在 create 阶段跑得好好的，只有 L1e 阶段翻车——这正是该问题难定位的原因。"
rec_approach: "两处都要做，缺一不可：(1) 删掉 test() 里的 can_run 静默短路。原生同架构执行器上产物本就能跑；真有跑不了的执行器应当显式失败，而不是零断言报成功（R34「0 执行一律不可交付」）。(2) 让 test_package 具备真实的编译期+链接期依赖：在 build() 里加一个 .c，#include 打包安装的头文件并链接打包的库，include/lib 路径取自 self.dependencies[ref].cpp_info.includedirs/libdirs。这样 L1e 把 include/ 与 lib/ 移走后，链接必然失败、测试必然失败，正是 L1e 期望的形态。验证方法必须复刻 L1e 的调用方式：`conan test <test_package> <ref> -pr <单个 profile 文件>`（用 -pr 而非 -pr:h/-pr:b），先跑一次应通过，再把 bin/ lib/ include/ 移走后跑一次应失败。排查该问题时先打探针打印 settings 与 settings_build，可立刻看出 build 侧回落到了默认 profile。"
match_keywords: ["L1e", "R34", "negative test", "fake test", "can_run", "cross_building", "settings_build", "conan test", "single -pr", "pr:h", "pr:b", "test_package", "cpp_info.includedirs", "cpp_info.libdirs", "destructive"]
error_excerpt: "[step] L1e: Destructive negative test (R34)...\n        [sabotage] bin/ moved away\n        [sabotage] lib/ moved away\n        [sabotage] include/ moved away\n[fail] L1e: test passed WITHOUT package artifacts — fake test detected (R34)\n        test does not depend on <pkg> — must call its API or execute its binary\n\n# 探针实测：\n# conan test … -pr     <file>  ->  host=OHOS/armv8  build=Linux/x86_64  cross_building=True   can_run=False\n# conan create … -pr:h -pr:b    ->  host=OHOS/armv8  build=OHOS/armv8    cross_building=False  can_run=True"
severity: P1
category: testing
last_updated: 2026-09-29
